\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact technology producing them
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A phased array built into the fence ends and beneath each opening. Electro-optic emitters manipulate ambient light; directional acoustic and electrostatic components provide the non-visual effects. The result is plainly controlled energy, not projected scenery or a hologram.\cell \row

