\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact visual appearance
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A perfectly flat, unsupported 
\f1\b sheet of smoke-dark distortion
\f2\b0  spanning the opening. The landscape remains visible through it, but edges misregister and straight lines break slightly as they cross it. Fine triangular interference patterns relate it visually to the fence and residence. It looks like something you could see through but not walk through.\cell \row

