\f1\b \cf0 exact texture
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A fine mesh of interlocking triangular interference lines continuously forms and dissolves across the surface. At moments it resembles smoked glass under tension; at others the pattern almost disappears, leaving only the optical discontinuity.\cell \row

