\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact colour behaviour
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Predominantly smoke-grey/graphite, borrowing colour from the scene behind it. Oblique light produces restrained spectral fringes\'97silver, violet, occasional bronze\'97rather than a single warning colour. Its colour is aesthetic/physical, not semantic.\cell \row

