\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact movement or behaviour
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 At rest the pattern moves slowly, almost below conscious notice. As something approaches, the local geometry becomes sharper and more active: triangular seams tighten, ripples run outward from the nearest point, and the optical discontinuity becomes harder to ignore. This is proximity response only, not identity recognition.\cell \row

