\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact iconography and presentation of the direct warning
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The warning is 
\f1\b physically separate from the membrane
\f2\b0 . The fence structures immediately flanking each opening resolve into high-contrast warning displays when checkpoint mode is active. A matching warning band appears on the road or pedestrian surface 
\f1\b before
\f2\b0  the screen. Text and a simple hazard glyph face approaching traffic. Nothing is written or projected onto the screen itself. No red/green traffic lights.\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth2529\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx4320
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth12951\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact offensive weapon mechanics
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A buried linear directed-energy array covers the full width and height of each corresponding opening. When armed, its emitters can rapidly sweep destructive energy across anything attempting to cross. There are no visible turrets or barrels and no exposed moving parts. The exact energy type need never be stated in narration. The apocryphal \'93laser burned through a soldier\'92s boot\'94 is therefore a plausible but unreliable simplification.\cell \row

