\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth2529\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx4320
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth12951\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact mechanism by which an active checkpoint segment can later be changed to permit passage
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The 
\f1\b remote operator manually safes that segment's weapons first
\f2\b0 . Once the system reports safe, the screen collapses and the direct warning disappears. The physical gate remains DOWN throughout. To restore checkpoint mode, the warning appears and the screen reforms first; the weapons are armed only after that warning state is established.\cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrt\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth2529\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx4320
\clvertalc \clshdrawnil \clwWidth12951\clftsWidth3 \clmart10 \clmarl10 \clmarb10 \clmarr10 \clbrdrt\brdrnil \clbrdrl\brdrnil \clbrdrb\brdrnil \clbrdrr\brdrnil \clpadt20 \clpadl20 \clpadb20 \clpadr20 \gaph\cellx8640
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 exact control process for making that change
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A human operator at a remote security station controls the three segments independently using live camera/audio feeds and communication with personnel at the entrance. Local checkpoint staff perform ticket checks, searches and inspection; when they are satisfied, they request passage. The remote operator manually clears the appropriate segment, keeps it clear for the required person, group or convoy, then manually restores checkpoint mode. There is no automatic traveller authentication or class-based admission.\cell \lastrow\row
